  "sn35.101:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.101 ",
  "sn35.101:0.2": "10. The Sixes ",
  "sn35.101:0.3": "It’s Not Yours (1st) ",
  "sn35.101:1.1": "“Mendicants, give up what’s not yours. ",
  "sn35.101:1.2": "Giving it up will be for your welfare and happiness. ",
  "sn35.101:1.3": "And what isn’t yours? ",
  "sn35.101:1.4": "The eye isn’t yours: give it up. ",
  "sn35.101:1.5": "",
  "sn35.101:1.6": "Giving it up will be for your welfare and happiness. ",
  "sn35.101:1.7": "Sights … ",
  "sn35.101:1.8": "",
  "sn35.101:1.9": "",
  "sn35.101:1.10": "Eye consciousness … ",
  "sn35.101:1.11": "",
  "sn35.101:1.12": "",
  "sn35.101:1.13": "Eye contact … ",
  "sn35.101:1.14": "",
  "sn35.101:1.15": "",
  "sn35.101:1.16": "The pleasant, painful, or neutral feeling that arises dependent on eye contact isn’t yours: give it up. ",
  "sn35.101:1.17": "",
  "sn35.101:1.18": "Giving it up will be for your welfare and happiness. ",
  "sn35.101:1.19": "",
